      "text": "{\"notifications\":[{\"id\":\"a272802e-b531-4647-8d09-cfd6eefdd681\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Weekly reliability: Sentry not connected\",\"body\":\"Week of Oct 17 to Oct 23: Sentry is not connected, so the error budget cannot be judged. The API answered 96,156 requests and returned 1 server errors. Set SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN, SENTRY_ORG and SENTRY_PROJECTS on the API to count errors against the budget of 10 a week.\\n\\nKiosk punches: n/a accepted (0 of 0).\\nRides: n/a completed (0 of 0).\\nAPI restarts: 1179. Server errors (5xx): 1 of 96,156 requests.\\n\\np95 for the busiest routes:\\n  GET /auth/me — 25 ms (14,518 calls)\\n  GET /communications/me/inbox — 75 ms (7,329 calls)\\n  GET /events/stream — 15000 ms (7,199 calls)\\n  POST /telemetry/web-vitals — 25 ms (6,081 calls)\\n  GET /me/inbox — 150 ms (4,492 calls)\\n  GET /auth/me/nav-pins — 50 ms (3,946 calls)\\n  GET /clients — 75 ms (3,926 calls)\\n  GET /hugo — 100 ms (3,402 calls)\\n  GET /associates/:id/photo — 25 ms (2,042 calls)\\n  GET /messages/unread — 75 ms (1,637 calls)\",\"category\":\"reliability_digest\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-24T12:07:55.919Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/reliability\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T12:07:55.920Z\"},{\"id\":\"a08866da-ad83-45ef-94ae-47f38075ced1\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Escalated: Coastal Resort Holdings is still waiting — Two more overnight stockers for Friday\",\"body\":\"Workforce was reminded yesterday and \\\"Two more overnight stockers for Friday\\\" from Coastal Resort Holdings is still open, 799h past its reply-by. The store is watching it age in their portal.\",\"category\":\"relay.escalation\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-24T04:18:35.888Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/relay#client-requests:e4d756b2-c63f-44b2-a276-2c470a3ca645:l2\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T04:18:35.888Z\"},{\"id\":\"55a659f3-f3dd-4346-925f-d8453a2932ab\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Overdue on your desk: Safety incidents to review\",\"body\":\"Safety incidents to review: 2 items overdue on HR's desk. The relay board is red until this clears — everyone can see it.\",\"category\":\"relay.escalation\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-24T04:18:35.842Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/relay#incidents\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T04:18:35.842Z\"},{\"id\":\"5713c597-fd44-49da-881c-0e3b409f5e2f\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Approval needed: Ana Reyes-Montgomery: starting pay $15.25 per hour\",\"body\":\"Starting pay, effective 2026-10-26 — above the rate card's pay for Housekeeper at Coastal Resort Holdings ($13.75)\",\"category\":\"approvals\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-23T19:01:43.629Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/approvals?tab=requests&approval=8a0acef8-3048-4aca-9731-da858baf53ef\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-23T19:01:43.630Z\"},{\"id\":\"838708f1-e134-41d4-a625-9001ed662f9f\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"[For Your Review] Onboarding ready — Tess Membermvl9501p (The Grand Hotel)\",\"body\":\"The following application has completed all onboarding requirements and is ready for final review.\\n\\n  Team member   Tess Membermvl9501p\\n  Submitted     2026-10-23 17:36 UTC\\n\\nThis notification is sent once per application. Subsequent task updates will not generate additional notices.\\n\\nOpen the application:\\n\\n———\\nThe Grand Hotel\\nWorkforce Management Operations\\nhr@altohr.com  ·  altohr.com\\n\\nThe Grand Hotel\\nStrategic staffing and workforce solutions for retail operations across the Florida Panhandle. People-first. Performance-driven.\\n495 Grand Boulevard, Suite 206, Miramar Beach FL 32550\\n(850) 805-3774  ·  info@altohr.com  ·  Mon–Fri · 8 AM – 5 PM CT\\n\\nCONFIDENTIAL — This message and any attachments are intended solely for\\nthe addressee and may contain confidential, proprietary, or legally\\nprivileged information. If you received this in error, please delete it\\nand notify the sender immediately.\\n\\nThe Grand Hotel will never ask you for your password, verification codes, full Social Security number, or bank credentials by email or text. If a message requesting any of these claims to be from us, do not respond — forward it to info@altohr.com.\\n\\nReplies to this address are not monitored. For assistance, contact your HR administrator.\\n\\nReference: ALT-MVL954W8-5RBU\",\"category\":\"onboarding\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-23T17:36:48.399Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/onboarding/applications/f6b95206-00a7-4689-8f3e-7caf62fb18cc\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-23T17:36:48.400Z\"},{\"id\":\"fec343be-1e35-4e4c-a94e-98ef1258f9db\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"6 compliance attestations need you — 5 overdue\",\"body\":\"• Workers Comp insurance current — overdue (was due Sat, Jan 31)\\n• General Liability insurance current — overdue (was due Sat, Jan 31)\\n• OSHA 300A summary posted (Feb 1 – Apr 30) — overdue (was due Sun, Feb 1)\\n• Monthly compliance report submitted — overdue (was due Mon, Oct 5)\\n• Fieldglass timesheet submitted (Mon 2pm PST) — overdue (was due Mon, Oct 19)\\n• Invoices reviewed for 90-day forfeiture window — due Fri, Oct 23\\n\\nOpen the Compliance scorecard to record each one — or snooze one you are handling elsewhere.\",\"category\":\"compliance.attestation.digest\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-23T16:34:57.224Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/compliance?tab=scorecard\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-23T16:34:57.225Z\"},{\"id\":\"65ffceb7-8e14-40ce-ab09-9d4ec8122948\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Escalated: Coastal Resort Holdings is still waiting — Two more overnight stockers for Friday\",\"body\":\"Workforce was reminded yesterday and \\\"Two more overnight stockers for Friday\\\" from Coastal Resort Holdings is still open, 780h past its reply-by. The store is watching it age in their portal.\",\"category\":\"relay.escalation\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-23T09:01:31.980Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/relay#client-requests:e4d756b2-c63f-44b2-a276-2c470a3ca645:l2\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-23T09:01:31.981Z\"},{\"id\":\"94e039a5-a239-4a7b-a647-33902e1e0ad5\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Over