hannel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Onboarding stalled: Maria at 0% (33d idle)\",\"body\":\"Maria's onboarding for Seaside Hospitality Group has been idle 33 days at 0% despite 4 reminders. Outstanding: Complete profile information, Take your profile photo, Upload identity documents, I-9 employment eligibility, W-4 tax withholding, Set up direct deposit or Branch card, Acknowledge company policies, Sign Associate Employment Agreement.\",\"category\":\"onboarding\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-22T16:21:54.953Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/onboarding/applications/b61916e8-8afc-454d-b01b-75c0fe7ed396\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-22T16:21:54.954Z\"},{\"id\":\"55fb879f-7e01-4e9b-9ce7-74fa5342f002\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Overdue: General Liability insurance current\",\"body\":\"Compliance attestation for January 2026 is overdue.\\n\\nWalmart MSA Section 7 — General Liability insurance must be in force at all times. Each year, confirm the policy is current and the certificate of insurance has been provided to Walmart. Attach the COI as evidence if available.\\n\\nOpen the Compliance scorecard → Billing & invoicing tile to record when you completed this and confirm the outcome.\",\"category\":\"compliance.attestation.GENERAL_LIABILITY.2026-01-01\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-21T08:23:42.664Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/compliance?tab=scorecard\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-21T08:23:42.665Z\"},{\"id\":\"faccef02-fa4f-4eb3-abc9-e63767658e2c\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Overdue: OSHA 300A summary posted (Feb 1 – Apr 30)\",\"body\":\"Compliance attestation for January 2026 is overdue.\\n\\nOSHA 1904.32 — certify the prior year’s Form 300A summary and post it at each establishment from February 1 through April 30. Confirm here once posted; attach the signed 300A as evidence if available.\\n\\nOpen the Compliance scorecard → Billing & invoicing tile to record when you completed this and confirm the outcome.\",\"category\":\"compliance.attestation.OSHA_300A_POSTING.2026-01-01\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-21T08:23:42.657Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/compliance?tab=scorecard\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-21T08:23:42.658Z\"},{\"id\":\"97af49aa-dd8e-4968-bdcf-dc4da86fbb1f\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Overdue: Workers Comp insurance current\",\"body\":\"Compliance attestation for January 2026 is overdue.\\n\\nWalmart MSA Section 7 — Workers Comp insurance must be in force at all times. Each year, confirm the policy is current and the certificate of insurance has been provided to Walmart. Attach the COI as evidence if available.\\n\\nOpen the Compliance scorecard → Billing & invoicing tile to record when you completed this and confirm the outcome.\",\"category\":\"compliance.attestation.WORKERS_COMP.2026-01-01\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-21T08:23:42.647Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/compliance?tab=scorecard\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-21T08:23:42.647Z\"},{\"id\":\"f190ba52-b0b9-45fb-b40d-23b54f89128a\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Overdue: Monthly compliance report submitted\",\"body\":\"Compliance attestation for October 2026 is overdue.\\n\\nWalmart SOW requires a monthly compliance report. Submit through the vendor portal and confirm here once filed.\\n\\nOpen the Compliance scorecard → Billing & invoicing tile to record when you completed this and confirm the outcome.\",\"category\":\"compliance.attestation.MONTHLY_REPORT.2026-10-01\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-21T08:23:42.623Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/compliance?tab=scorecard\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-21T08:23:42.623Z\"},{\"id\":\"5fc34121-257f-4784-9838-f49265b48cac\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Escalated: Coastal Resort Holdings is still waiting — Two more overnight stockers for Friday\",\"body\":\"Workforce was reminded yesterday and \\\"Two more overnight stockers for Friday\\\" from Coastal Resort Holdings is still open, 727h past its reply-by. The store is watching it age in their portal.\",\"category\":\"relay.escalation\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-21T04:14:49.214Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/relay#client-requests:e4d756b2-c63f-44b2-a276-2c470a3ca645:l2\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-21T04:14:49.214Z\"},{\"id\":\"a8388718-e52f-475d-9adf-ebee8cd9bcfb\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Overdue: Fieldglass timesheet submitted (Mon 2pm PST)\",\"body\":\"Compliance attestation for the week of 2026-10-19 is overdue.\\n\\nWalmart SOW — Fieldglass timesheet must be submitted by Monday 2pm PST every week. Confirm here once it's filed.\\n\\nOpen the Compliance scorecard → Billing & invoicing tile to record when you completed this and confirm the outcome.\",\"category\":\"compliance.attestation.FIELDGLASS_TIMESHEET.2026-10-19\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-21T01:24:14.952Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/compliance?tab=scorecard\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-21T01:24:14.953Z\"},{\"id\":\"2acea675-f23f-4a56-a3fc-c544f90de160\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Onboarding stalled: Maria at 0% (31d idle)\",\"body\":\"Maria's onboarding for Seaside Hospitality Group has been idle 31 days at 0% despite 3 reminders. Outstanding: Complete profile information, Take your profile photo, Upload identity documents, I-9 employment eligibility, W-4 tax withholding, Set up direct deposit or Branch card, Acknowledge company policies, Sign Associate Employment Agreement.\",\"category\":\"onboarding\",\"externalRef\":null,\"providerMessageId\":null,\"failureReason\":null,\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-20T12:16:53.216Z\",\"readAt\":null,\"seenAt\":null,\"senderUserId\":null,\"senderEmail\":null,\"linkUrl\":\"/onboarding/applications/b61916e8-8afc-454d-b01b-75c0fe7ed396\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-20T12:16:53.217Z\"},{\"id\":\"9acd3c39-f5c5-45fb-a8f1-4cc7bba4bb10\",\"channel\":\"IN_APP\",\"status\":\"SENT\",\"recipientUserId\":\"59431ae2-972f-4874-8212-dca6a7ab55ca\",\"recipientPhone\":null,\"recipientEmail\":null,\"subject\":\"Overdue: General Liability insurance current\",\"body\":\"Compliance attestation for January 2026 is overdue.\\n\\nWalmart MSA Section 7 — General Liability insurance must be in force at all times. E